# catmosh: the film's five parts, in its order, bars and tempi
# (from catmosh score3.json: part starts 0.3, 9.0, 19.8, 29.6, 40.5 s; end 51.1 s).
# bars N WAY [amount A] [tempo BPM]; the tempo drives the internal clock (a playing
# TR-808 keeps its own). "end" stops the mosh; "loop" would start again.

bars 5  wrap  amount 70  tempo 138
bars 9  tear  amount 80  tempo 200
bars 7  mosh  amount 85  tempo 170
bars 12 bleed amount 85  tempo 264
bars 7  raw   amount 90  tempo 158
end
